      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but the hero stuff doesnt mean much at 3am. it just feels like... heavy. like there's no point in trying to fix something that's just broken by design. i'm just so worn out by the constant struggle to keep things from falling apart. i don't even know what i'm fighting for anymore.",
